    <div class="content-box" style="font-size: 8pt; line-height: 1.2; padding: 4px 6px; margin-bottom: 5px;">
      <p><strong>GitHub Repository:</strong> <span style="color: #0d6288;">https://github.com/parisinghal017-hue/FUNDNEXUS-Fund-Management-System.git</span><br>
      <strong>Active Working Branch:</strong> <code>main</code><br>
      We kept our project clean and divided into dedicated folders: <code>cpp_engine/</code> contains all our C++ headers, source files, and build.bat for compiling <code>engine.exe</code>; <code>backend/</code> holds our Python HTTP server and IPC connector; <code>database/</code> has <code>schema.sql</code> and SQLite helper scripts; <code>js/</code> and <code>css/</code> house our frontend views and styling; and <code>tests/</code> holds our automated test suites.</p>
      <p style="margin-top: 3px;"><strong>Important Phase 3 Commits:</strong><br>
      &bull; <code>657b0c0</code>: <em>feat(donor-portal): display active verified campaigns table and instant donation actions</em><br>
