    <div class="section-title">Deliverables Progress (2 pts)</div>
    <div class="instruction-sub">(Summarize the current status of all key project deliverables mentioned earlier. Indicate whether each deliverable is completed, in progress, or pending.)</div>
    <div class="content-box" style="font-size: 8pt; line-height: 1.22; padding: 4px 6px; margin-bottom: 2px;">
      <p>All key project deliverables for FundNexus are 100% finished and tested:</p>
      <p>&bull; <strong>C++ Core DSA Engine:</strong> <strong>Completed (100%)</strong> &mdash; Custom Linked List, FIFO queue, Jaccard similarity detector, and risk analyzer compiled into <code>engine.exe</code>.<br>
      &bull; <strong>Python REST Server &amp; IPC Bridge:</strong> <strong>Completed (100%)</strong> &mdash; Lightweight multithreaded backend handling REST routes and C++ subprocess calls.<br>
      &bull; <strong>SQLite Database &amp; 3NF Schema:</strong> <strong>Completed (100%)</strong> &mdash; Fully normalized relational database with foreign keys and atomic transaction support.<br>
      &bull; <strong>4-Tier Web Application:</strong> <strong>Completed (100%)</strong> &mdash; Interactive single-page application with Guest, Donor, Fundraiser, and Admin dashboards.<br>
      &bull; <strong>Proof Upload &amp; Verification Modals:</strong> <strong>Completed (100%)</strong> &mdash; Expense submission forms, receipt image lightboxes, and admin approval buttons.<br>
      &bull; <strong>80G Tax Exemption Receipts:</strong> <strong>Completed (100%)</strong> &mdash; Automatic tax receipt generation with donor name, PAN, and transaction ID.<br>
      &bull; <strong>Automated Test Suites:</strong> <strong>Completed (100%)</strong> &mdash; Unit, financial integrity, and end-to-end integration tests fully verified.<br>
      &bull; <strong>Technical Documentation:</strong> <strong>Completed (100%)</strong> &mdash; GitHub repository README, system architecture guide, and viva manual.</p>
